good:
{name},

We got your last message and everyone here is well. The garden came in nicely this year and we sold most of it. Keep your head down and come home soon.

Love, {sender}

Dear {name},

I got the job at the shipyard! It's steady work and the pay is decent. We're all doing fine, so don't worry about us.

{sender}

{name},

The baby's walking now, if you can believe it. Everyone asks after you. We'll have a big dinner the day you're out.

Love, {sender}

Hey {name},

Just writing to say we paid off the loan. It's a weight off all of us. Hope they're feeding you properly in there.

{sender}

kid:
To {name},

This is our house and this is the dog. We don't have a dog yet but you said maybe. Please come home soon.

Love from your kid, and from {sender}

Hi {name},

I lost a tooth and got two credits for it. This is you flying a ship. It's a very fast ship.

From your kid, sent by {sender}

news:
{name},

Not much to report. The station put the docking fees up again and everyone's grumbling about it. Your cousin says hello.

{sender}

Dear {name},

The old market closed down and they're building a hangar there instead. It's been raining for a week. Write back if they let you.

{sender}

{name},

There was a big pirate scare out past the belt, but it came to nothing. Prices are up and wages aren't. Same as ever.

Take care, {sender}

bad:
{name},

I don't know how to say this, so I'll just say it. Grandpa passed last week. It was quiet and he wasn't in pain.

{sender}

Dear {name},

We've lost the flat. The rent went up again and we couldn't keep up. We're staying with friends for now, so try not to worry.

{sender}

{name},

The ship I was crewing on got impounded, and I'm out of work. I don't know what's next. Sorry to put this on you.

{sender}

{name},

The dog got out and we couldn't find him. We looked everywhere, for days. I'm so sorry.

{sender}

contraband:
{name},

Nothing much new here. I tucked a little something in with this, so don't let anyone see it. Stay safe.

{sender}

Dear {name},

The weather's turned and the station's quiet. There's something extra in the envelope that might help. Keep it to yourself.

{sender}

{name},

Your friend from the old crew asked me to send this along. They didn't say what it was for and I didn't ask. Take care of yourself.

{sender}
